owing their explosive showdown, Godzilla and Kong must reunite against a colossal undiscovered threat hidden within our world, challenging their very existence – and our own.","poster_path":"/z1p34vh7dEOnLDmyCrlUVLuoDzd.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[28,12,878],"popularity":21.5534,"release_date":"2024-03-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.032,"vote_count":4949},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qpqKeG0TujGRHvk6bnvmoGGvVMN.jpg","id":18289,"title":"Godzilla vs. Biollante","original_title":"ゴジラvsビオランテ","overview":"After the previous Godzilla attack, a miniature arms race ensues to collect his cells. Concerned over Godzilla's possible return, the Japanese government uses the cells to create a new bio-weapon, ANEB (Anti-Nuclear Energy Bacteria). They seeks the aid of geneticist Genshiro Shiragami, who's experiments result in a new mutation.","poster_path":"/dAr3SzPTfKP23uILP4BBiML8MVG.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[28,27,878],"popularity":4.2518,"release_date":"1989-12-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.342,"vote_count":323},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/q3j4OQFFDKM6fdQt9gE56kfDBNG.jpg","id":536115,"title":"Godzilla: The Planet Eater","original_title":"GODZILLA 星を喰う者","overview":"With no means for defeating Godzilla Earth, mankind watches as King Ghidorah, clad in a golden light, descends on the planet. The heavens and earth shake once again as the war moves to a higher dimension.","poster_path":"/fOA44BITFth0u4hMSOUgpK0kM6t.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,878,28,12],"popularity":7.9815,"release_date":"2018-11-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.505,"vote_count":414},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nv60CvL3fjosoJytnBcdJcF5l0L.jpg","id":10643,"title":"Godzilla 2000: Millennium","original_title":"ゴジラ2000 ミレニアム","overview":"An independent group of researchers called the Godzilla Prediction Network (GPN) actively track Godzilla as he makes landfall in Nemuro.  Matters are further complicated when a giant meteor is discovered in the Ibaragi Prefecture. The mysterious rock begins to levitate as it's true intentions for the world and Godzilla are revealed.","poster_path":"/7BrjFxV0j5VzZRfVYeYbFXMUweB.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[28,12,878],"popularity":3.0582,"release_date":"1999-12-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.867,"vote_count":332},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/fDkwRFthToJTJN1rhf9zAAA1fcF.jpg","id":12636,"title":"Godzilla Against MechaGodzilla","original_title":"ゴジラ×メカゴジラ","overview":"JSDF pilot Akane has a fateful encounter when a new Godzilla emerges in Tateyama. As a countermeasure, a cyborg named Kiryu is constructed from the remains of the original. The machine is discovered to harbor the restless soul of the original monster as Akane must learn to find value in her own life as well.","poster_path":"/Kg6J3qyf80cwnKkv1YorSjkNaK.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[28,878,53],"popularity":3.2029,"release_date":"2002-11-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.469,"vote_count":278},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/l4gfTsSZkVofKxzcqMCTBUkeHw8.jpg","id":3107,"title":"Destroy All Monsters","original_title":"怪獣総進撃","overview":"At the turn of the century, all of the Earth's monsters have been rounded up and kept safely on Monsterland. Chaos erupts when a race of she-aliens known as the Kilaaks unleash the monsters across the world.","poster_path":"/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[878,28],"popularity":3.5231,"release_date":"1968-08-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.857,"vote_count":312},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg","id":315011,"title":"Shin Godzilla","original_title":"シン・ゴジラ","overview":"When a massive, gilled monster emerges from the deep and tears through the city, the governme